A wiki is not the place to tell people how they aren't allowed to
play. Instead, its role is to be useful to people the way they really
do play. A large majority of players found on nethack.alt.org,
#nethack on freenode.net, nethack.wikia.com, and RGRN play using all
the resources the game gives them. Avoiding the artifact naming trick
(or bones files ID, or startscumming, or pudding farming, ...) is a
legitiate unofficial conduct to follow, but it is by no means the only
or even most common way.


